{"title":"Saturday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/927376121/0/marginalrevolution~Saturday-assorted-links.html","date":1762603777000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://thezvi.substack.com/p/on-sam-altmans-second-conversation?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=573100&amp;post_id=178132630&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Zvi (NN) on my podcast with Sam Altman</a>.  I will note that GPT-5 is very good at picking out restaurants for me in northern Spain, and Neruda you have to read in Spanish, otherwise it is lame.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.thefp.com/p/peter-thiel-capitalism-isnt-working-for-young-people\" target=\"_blank\">Peter Thiel on young people and socialism</a> (Free Press).</p>\r\n<p>3.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2025/11/06/heritage-foundation-tucker-carlson/\" target=\"_blank\"> Is the Heritage Foundation imploding?</a></p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://illuminatingfertility.substack.com/p/20252026-fertility-job-market-papers?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5497636&amp;post_id=178315830&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Fertility job market papers</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/MyRadarWX/status/1986880795555025256\" target=\"_blank\">Iguana advisory for Florida</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3TwhvC_iPCc&amp;t=903s\" target=\"_blank\">The full twenty minute Sydney Sweeney GQ interview is worth watching</a>.  Few books about sociology are this valuable.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/Sergio_Econ/status/1986831562000814274\" target=\"_blank\">memed</a>, about free trade.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/saturday-assorted-links-534.html\">Saturday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/927376121/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/927376121/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/927376121/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/927376121/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/927376121/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/927376121/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/saturday-assorted-links-534.html#respond\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/saturday-assorted-links-534.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> </div>","author":"Tyler Cowen","siteTitle":"Marginal Revolution","siteHash":"242a3a39129b36e0c574c3796ca7ef3cf8af967286c2998fabf7240d1ad52a47","entryHash":"b5091f9d8743d014b7b16da515905206133fd85a9e1cab